  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Change the edt first when selectedFrameChange to avoid a crash",
  "description": "After d7dc43734980188fda8b1a8172681d6c15351cc2 the Data Source View\ntries to re-highlight the old selected frame, if any, when leaving.\n\nThat makes it important that DataSourceTab update the current\nepan_dissect_t if necessary before calling clear(), so that we\ndon't try to select a field from a no longer valid edt_ (because\nthe packet is deselected, whether from the capture file being\nredissected, closing, or any other reason.)\n\nAlternatively, we could, it seems, get away without calling clear()\nfor the DataSourceTab because each child tab is automatically removed\nwhen deleted due to signals and slots already set up by Qt. That\nwould avoid triggering the LeaveEvents, it seems.\n\nPrevents a crash.",
